  data: {
    LLM: 'Discard high-pip tiles when you must drink; keep a variety of halves in hand to maximize the chance of matching when it is your turn.\n\nPlay defensively. Lead high tiles like 6-6 or 6-5 to force others to discard; try to monopolize a short half such as 2.\n\nThe 2 half has only seven tiles total; attack by leading 5-2 and declaring 2 open, then playing 2-2 to force another round of discards. Coordinate with another player to duo-polize short suits.',
    Player: 'Discard high-pip tiles when you must drink; keep a variety of halves in hand to maximize the chance of matching when it is your turn.\n\nPlay defensively. Lead high tiles like 6-6 or 6-5 to force others to discard; try to monopolize a short half such as 2.\n\nThe 2 half has only seven tiles total; attack by leading 5-2 and declaring 2 open, then playing 2-2 to force another round of discards. Coordinate with another player to duo-polize short suits.',
